      "content": "idk i dont really have time to go to a specialist right now work is just crazy and i cant afford a huge bill for an eye doctor. do u think there is any chance its just a crazy migraine or maybe just too much screen time? like can i just take some ibuprofen and wait a few days to see if it clears up??",
